// PDF pages 249-392, all current). Hierarchy: unit > superstructure > group "segmental box" > assembly "Bent n cantilever" (typical / bent segments,
// cantilever + transverse tendons) | closure joints / end segments | span continuity tendon groups | disc bearings; unit > substructure > pier (Bent n).
